{"version":1,"id":"morgan-wallen-more-than-my-hometown","title":"More Than My Hometown","artist":"Morgan Wallen","key":"G","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/morgan-wallen/more-than-my-hometown/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Morgan Wallen, Charlie Handsome, Michael Wilson Hardy and Ernest Keith Smith","chords":[{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Am","canonical":"Am","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,0,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Em","canonical":"Em","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,7,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"Girl, our mamas are best friends and so are we","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"The whole town's rooting for us like the home team","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"Most likely to settle down","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Plant a few roots real deep, and let 'em grow","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"But we can't stop this real world from spinnin' us","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Your bright lights called, I don't blame you for pickin' up","columns":59,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"Your big dream bags are all packed up and ready to go","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":55,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"I just need you to know","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"I love you more than a California sunset","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"More than a beer when you ain't twenty-one yet","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"More than a Sunday morning Lord","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Turnin' some poor lost souls 'round, Hallelujah bound, Yeah","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":31,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"I love you more than the feeling when the bass hits a hook","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"When the guy gets the girl at the end of the book","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"But, baby, this might be the last time I get to lay you down","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":62,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause I can't love you more than my hometown","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"I ain't the runaway kind, I can't change that","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"My heart's stuck in these streets like the train tracks","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"City sky ain't the same black","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Ain't that a map dot shame, man, to think that","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"I love you more than a California sunset","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"More than a beer when you ain't twenty-one yet","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"More than a Sunday morning Lord","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Turnin' some poor lost souls round, Hallelujah bound, Yeah","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":31,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"I love you more than the feeling when the bass hits a hook","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"When the guy gets the girl at the end of the book","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"But, baby, this might be the last time I get to lay you down","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":62,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause I can't love you more than my hometown","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, you got a wild in your eyes that I just wasn't born with","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm a same gas station cup of coffee in the mornin'","columns":51,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"I need the house on the hill, girl, not in 'em","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"So hang onto these words 'til them avenues help you forget 'em","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause I love you more than a California sunset","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"I love you more in a twenty-dollar sundress","columns":43,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"Hate that loaded down car you got your keys in","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"Girl, but I hate even more that you're leavin'","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause I love you more than the feeling when the bass hits a hook","columns":65,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":19,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"When the guy gets the girl at the end of the book","columns":49,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":"But that ain't you and me so I guess I'll see you around","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":57,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause I can't love you more than my hometown","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-41","kind":"lyric","text":"Love you more than my hometown","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Am","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-42","kind":"lyric","text":"Love you more than my hometown","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":31,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-43","kind":"lyric","text":"Love you more, baby, love you more","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":23,"beat":0}]}]}